      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "794c5b17000749c9fd7728de564a3625481655af09f713c1289cad1da31be6a2:000002_7422825699907458678:g0:r7",
      "row_index_0based": 7,
      "serialized_row_index": 7,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "謎の襲撃者集団を襲撃した主人公たちは、\nその後も、とにかく襲撃しまくり、何とか親書を３通集めた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
